Hi Alex, and the Dojo Customer Support and Integration Support teams,

Thank you, Alex, for explaining the process. Here is our staging site for the=
 online checkout review, built to your go-live checklist:

  https://menu.pontardawerfc.com/

Card payments on this site are on Dojo's sandbox (the "PontardaweRFC Demo" ke=
y) and marked Test mode on the menu. A test order is never sent to the club's=
 till, kitchen or takings, so you can test freely.

HOW TO TEST
1. Open menu.pontardawerfc.com and tap Tap to say which table you are at; any=
 table will do.
2. Add something to the basket and open it. Choose Pay now by card (test) and=
 press Pay =C2=A3x by card.
3. Pay on Dojo's checkout with your sandbox test cards (including the 3-D Sec=
ure and decline cards).
4. You come back to the order tracker: Test payment complete, or Payment not =
finished with the options to try again.

WEBSITE CHECKLIST
- Contact details: The foot of the menu shows the address, telephone and emai=
l; a Contact us link goes to pontardawerfc.com/contact.
- Legal entity name: Pontardawe Rugby Football Club Limited, company no. 1005=
6776, at the foot of the menu and in the terms.
- Refund policy: A clearly labelled Refund policy: pontardawerfc.com/ordering=
-terms#refunds, linked from the menu.
- Privacy policy: pontardawerfc.com/privacy, which names Dojo (Paymentsense L=
imited) for online card payments.
- Card scheme logos: Visa, Mastercard, Apple Pay and Google Pay at the foot o=
f the menu.
- Terms and conditions: Ordering terms and refund policy, naming the legal en=
tity, with a "Paying online by card" section.
- Secure checkout page: HTTPS throughout; card details are entered only on Do=
jo's hosted checkout (pay.dojo.tech).

END-TO-END HANDLING, READY FOR YOUR TESTING
1. Successful payment: Dojo redirects back to the order tracker, which reads =
the result from the payment intent (never from the redirect).
2. Unsuccessful payment: the tracker shows Payment not finished, with Pay now=
, Pay at the bar and Cancel. Nothing goes to the kitchen.
3. Successful payment after an unsuccessful one: Pay now refreshes the client=
 session secret (refresh-client-session-secret) before returning to the check=
out.
4. 3-D Secure, successful and unsuccessful: handled on Dojo's checkout page; =
the result comes back through the intent.
5. Cancel: back to the tracker, the intent is cancelled and the customer is t=
old nothing was charged.
6. Webhooks: payment_intent.status_updated, signature verified, at https://po=
ntardawerfc.com/dojo_test_webhook (PontardaweRFC Demo).
7. Refunds: a paid order cancelled on the till or kitchen screen is refunded =
through the API, with an idempotency key.

SWITCHING TO PRODUCTION
Each venue chooses its key in our back office under Card Payments > Online ch=
eckout: Demo (sandbox), its Pay at Counter key, or a live key enabled for Rem=
ote Payments. Pontardawe RFC will apply for Online Checkout through Account a=
ctivation in their Dojo Developer Portal, with menu.pontardawerfc.com as the =
website, as you advised.

Please let us know any points to address and we will turn them round quickly.

Many thanks for your help.

Kind regards,
Muzahid Islam
Vesopa Developer, Vesopa Software Ltd
muzahid@vesopa.com

